@host = http://localhost:8083

### Creer un compte (5000 MAD)
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/add
Content-Type: application/json

{"initialBalance":5000,"currency":"MAD"}

> {% client.global.set("accountId", response.body); %}

### Creer un compte avec solde negatif (doit echouer)
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/add
Content-Type: application/json

{"initialBalance":-100,"currency":"MAD"}

### Credit 2000
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","amount":2000,"currency":"MAD"}

### Credit negatif -5 (doit echouer)
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/credit
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","amount":-5,"currency":"MAD"}

### Debit 1000
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","amount":1000,"currency":"MAD"}

### Debit 999999 (solde insuffisant, doit echouer)
POST {{host}}/commands/accounts/debit
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","amount":999999,"currency":"MAD"}

### Statut SUSPENDED
PUT {{host}}/commands/accounts/updateStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","status":"SUSPENDED"}

### Statut ACTIVATED
PUT {{host}}/commands/accounts/updateStatus
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":"{{accountId}}","status":"ACTIVATED"}

### Evenements du compte
GET {{host}}/commands/accounts/events/{{accountId}}
